<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN Capital lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN Capital lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Monday it had lowered its rating on EVEREN Capital Corp to neutral from outperform.  </p>
<p>-- further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 1-3/8 to 33-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
